s1-p22 = prose (cons "The event being interpreted need not be a sentence: a gesture, an image, or an instrument reading enters through its specified observation and interaction. Their interpretation is not established merely by assigning a label. The relation to the participant's context determines what has been observed, what remains possible, and what is warranted. Natural-language interpretation and perception consequently belong to the process account itself, rather than entering as software applications after its foundations have been fixed." nil)
